WEBVTT

00:00:00.830 --> 00:00:04.880
After coming to the Dust 
Zone to rescue Nene,

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:08.040
we became friends with 
Pinocchimon and the ToyAgumons

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:11.190
and we defeated GrandLocomon, 
the Digimon who controlled the Zone.

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:16.890
But then, DarkKnightmon 
and his forces attacked!

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:18.860
We meet again.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:25.070
I wanted you to see my new fighting force.

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:26.440
That's...

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:27.970
Kiriha?

00:00:27.970 --> 00:00:30.340
Yes, Kiriha Aonuma.

00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:32.690
The blue Xros Loader...

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:37.060
That is my new fighting force.

00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:38.050
No way!

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:42.750
<b>Team Bagra</b>

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:42.750
<b>Team Twilight      Xros Heart (Team Taiki)   Team Blue Flare</b>

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:42.750
Protagonist                                                                  Rival

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:51.780
<b>The Decisive Battle!</b>

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:51.780
<b>DarkKnightmon VS Xros Heart!</b>

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:49.750
The Decisive Battle! 
DarkKnightmon vs. Xros Heart!

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:57.170
Ground Zero!

00:00:57.170 --> 00:00:58.640
Nail Bone!

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:04.080
Follow me! This way!

00:01:08.950 --> 00:01:11.920
No matter where you 
hide, it won't help you.

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:13.120
This is the end!

00:01:14.450 --> 00:01:16.220
Down this dust chute!

00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:41.660
Eight, nine, ten!

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:47.660
Dah... di, du, de, do!

00:01:48.390 --> 00:01:49.920
Ow...

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:52.560
Not you, too!

00:01:55.370 --> 00:01:57.790
Is this some kind of giant trash can?

00:01:57.790 --> 00:01:59.230
It looks like one.

00:01:59.230 --> 00:02:02.200
But you really saved us, Pinocchimon.

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:05.940
I know every nook and 
cranny of the Dust Zone.

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:09.090
But the enemy might come after us.

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:11.180
Just ride on me to escape!

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:13.110
They got away?

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:16.300
They likely used this dust chute.

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:19.190
If they knew about this escape route,

00:02:19.190 --> 00:02:23.190
that must mean they've befriended 
the Digimon of this Zone.

00:02:23.190 --> 00:02:24.260
Most likely.

00:02:24.890 --> 00:02:28.270
But why would a guy with 
as much pride as Kiriha

00:02:28.270 --> 00:02:30.760
become DarkKnightmon's subordinate?

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:32.550
Maybe they finally fought,

00:02:32.550 --> 00:02:36.560
and DarkKnightmon was so 
strong, Kiriha chickened out?

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:39.390
No, he's not that type.

00:02:39.390 --> 00:02:43.900
Well, anyway, just leave Nene 
to me, Zenjirou Tsurugi!

00:02:43.900 --> 00:02:45.310
What should we do, Taiki?

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:46.940
Don't ignore me.

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:48.450
Something's coming.

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:50.280
The guys chasing us?

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:51.720
No, that's...

00:02:52.990 --> 00:02:54.200
It's Sparrowmon!

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:56.930
Did something happen to Nene?

00:02:56.930 --> 00:03:01.230
DarkKnightmon locked her 
away in the prison tower.

00:03:01.230 --> 00:03:03.070
The prison tower...

00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:06.130
The same tower that 
DarkKnightmon brought me to?

00:03:06.130 --> 00:03:10.140
Yes. Please free Nene for me!

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:14.620
Why do we have to do all 
that for your sake?!

00:03:14.620 --> 00:03:16.940
You know, I heard that...

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:20.100
the reason Nene can't defy DarkKnightmon

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:22.710
is because of her little 
brother. Is that true?

00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:27.250
Yes. DarkKnightmon took 
her brother hostage

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:29.720
so he could make her do as he wished.

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:32.990
Nene cares so much for her brother!

00:03:32.990 --> 00:03:35.240
I want to be her brother, too!

00:03:35.240 --> 00:03:37.090
Let's brother!

00:03:35.240 --> 00:03:39.590
What was DarkKnightmon 
making Nene do?

00:03:39.590 --> 00:03:42.460
He was gathering dark power

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:45.300
to restore the Darkness Loader.

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:47.150
Darkness Loader?

00:03:47.150 --> 00:03:48.270
What is that?

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:51.010
I don't know either.

00:03:51.350 --> 00:03:54.050
<i>Could it have been that...</i>

00:03:54.050 --> 00:03:57.370
Forget about the Darkness Loader for now.

00:03:57.370 --> 00:03:59.780
You're going to say the same thing 
as always about Nene, right?

00:03:59.780 --> 00:04:01.420
Yeah. I can't turn my back on her.

00:04:01.780 --> 00:04:05.540
But, General, what do we 
do about her brother?

00:04:08.020 --> 00:04:10.380
Only one thing matters right now.

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:13.060
We have to save Nene 
from DarkKnightmon.

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:14.750
Everything else comes after that.

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:18.640
In other words, you're just gonna 
charge in there blindly, right?

00:04:18.640 --> 00:04:21.810
All right! Let's shout!

00:04:21.810 --> 00:04:23.940
We'll help, too!

00:04:24.310 --> 00:04:25.420
Thanks.

00:04:25.420 --> 00:04:27.090
But rather than everyone going at once,

00:04:27.090 --> 00:04:28.980
we'll go first to check it out.

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:30.050
But...

00:04:30.050 --> 00:04:31.930
Don't worry.

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:33.320
We'll be fine.

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:37.320
So this is the Dust Zone?

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:39.420
It's no good! No good, no good!

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:41.890
A Zone buried in garbage is the worst!

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:44.950
But I'm sure I can use it as a dump

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:47.450
for all the Zones I've conquered.

00:04:47.450 --> 00:04:48.650
No! No!

00:04:48.650 --> 00:04:51.170
It's already full of trash! You can't!

00:04:51.670 --> 00:04:54.050
Well, if it isn't Lilithmon.

00:04:55.240 --> 00:04:56.520
And you are?

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:59.290
The knight of darkness, DarkKnightmon.

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:00.710
DarkKnightmon?

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:05.020
I am the leader of Team Twilight.

00:05:05.020 --> 00:05:07.690
Oh? Never heard of them.

00:05:07.690 --> 00:05:11.360
I'm sure. But it would do you 
well to remember the name.

00:05:11.360 --> 00:05:15.290
We already possess power to 
rival that of the Bagra Army.

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:17.660
You are a smooth talker, if nothing else.

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:19.260
I don't dislike that.

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:21.530
Are you familiar with this boy?

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:26.300
The boy with the blue Xros Loader.

00:05:26.770 --> 00:05:28.790
Kiriha Aonuma.

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:31.300
He is now my subordinate.

00:05:31.300 --> 00:05:35.380
In other words, 
all the Digimon and Code Crowns

00:05:35.380 --> 00:05:37.520
he has gathered are mine.

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:42.110
I guess you're not just a smooth talker.

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:45.990
And? What business do 
you have with me?

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:47.840
There must be something.

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:49.340
Very astute.

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:53.530
The boy with the red Xros 
Loader is hiding in this Zone.

00:05:53.940 --> 00:05:57.470
Would you care to work with 
me until he is eliminated?

00:05:57.470 --> 00:05:59.720
No way! No! No!

00:05:59.720 --> 00:06:03.610
I've heard that the Bagra Army 
is having a hard time with him.

00:06:03.990 --> 00:06:05.410
Is that so?

00:06:05.410 --> 00:06:09.120
I have the bait that will lure that boy.

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:13.010
The same bait that Kiriha 
Aonuma here readily took.

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:16.290
I will finish him when he 
arrives to take that bait.

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:21.230
Then I will give his Code Crowns to you.

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:22.520
Fine with me.

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:26.600
But I will only cooperate with you 
until all of Xros Heart is defeated.

00:06:26.600 --> 00:06:29.500
Of course, that is fine.

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:32.570
<i>Which means, if I should stab 
you in the back after that,</i>

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:34.410
<i>you'll hold no grudges.</i>

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:37.320
<i>Once the Darkness Loader is activated,</i>

00:06:37.320 --> 00:06:39.210
<i>all of you will be...</i>

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:47.430
Where is Nene?

00:06:47.430 --> 00:06:49.430
The prison on the top floor.

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:51.220
I'll take you there.

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:53.500
Zenjirou Tsurugi, the best swordsman

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:54.940
in Koto Ward, is going, too!

00:06:54.940 --> 00:06:56.290
And me, of course!

00:06:56.290 --> 00:06:58.130
I have to carry all of you?

00:06:58.130 --> 00:07:00.390
That's as far as you go, Taiki Kudou.

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:02.570
Kiriha!

00:07:07.510 --> 00:07:11.170
The monsters born in the 
Digital realm: Digimon.

00:07:11.170 --> 00:07:13.680
They may be made up of data,

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:18.550
but they're our precious friends 
who cry, laugh, and fight for us.

00:07:18.550 --> 00:07:20.620
Join us in our world of adventure

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:24.190
as we gather lots more teammates!

00:07:24.190 --> 00:07:25.260
DigiXros!

00:08:47.450 --> 00:08:49.140
Deckerdra-Launcher.

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:54.180
Wait! Why did you become 
DarkKnightmon's subordinate?!

00:08:55.750 --> 00:08:56.550
Taiki!

00:09:00.860 --> 00:09:04.740
Taiki, we have no choice but to fight!

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:10.090
Kiriha, listen to me!

00:09:10.090 --> 00:09:13.280
MetalGreymon, Giga Destroyer.

00:09:14.440 --> 00:09:15.270
Look out!

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:30.110
At this rate, we'll all be killed!

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:31.620
Kiriha...

00:09:31.620 --> 00:09:33.900
His eyes just now...

00:09:33.900 --> 00:09:36.250
He looks like someone is manipulating him.

00:09:36.250 --> 00:09:37.310
Someone?

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:38.690
It's not me!

00:09:38.690 --> 00:09:41.510
Kiriha's not the only one acting strange.

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:44.400
All of Blue Flare is being manipulated.

00:09:56.040 --> 00:09:58.680
Kiriha, have you no shame?

00:09:59.140 --> 00:10:00.410
Shame?

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:04.050
Your Digimon followed you here 
because they trusted you.

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:06.350
Yet you...

00:10:07.090 --> 00:10:10.090
You're betraying your 
precious companions!

00:10:10.090 --> 00:10:12.320
I'm betraying them?

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:15.950
That's right! You and the 
Digimon following you...

00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:18.030
You haven't been fighting 
all this time just to

00:10:18.030 --> 00:10:19.400
become DarkKnightmon's underlings!

00:10:19.400 --> 00:10:21.130
I...

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:22.580
Didn't you say so yourself?

00:10:22.580 --> 00:10:23.630
That you wouldn't give in?!

00:10:23.630 --> 00:10:26.640
That you'd change the Digital 
World with your own strength?!

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:27.510
Wake up!

00:10:39.020 --> 00:10:40.430
That won't work.

00:10:42.190 --> 00:10:43.240
DarkKnightmon!

00:10:43.900 --> 00:10:49.090
Kiriha Aonuma is a member of 
my Team Twilight for life.

00:10:50.360 --> 00:10:53.180
Now, finish them.

00:10:53.180 --> 00:10:54.630
As you wish.

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:55.480
Kiriha!

00:10:55.480 --> 00:10:59.200
We will show you our blue burning flame.

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:03.010
We are Blue Flare!

00:11:09.470 --> 00:11:10.720
What?!

00:11:17.460 --> 00:11:18.870
Lord DarkKnightmon!

00:11:25.960 --> 00:11:28.130
Kiriha! You're back to normal!

00:11:28.130 --> 00:11:31.000
That punch of yours was pretty good.

00:11:33.930 --> 00:11:36.760
The dog has already bitten 
the hand that feeds it?

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:39.280
That's no good! No good, no good!

00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:40.560
Lilithmon!

00:11:40.560 --> 00:11:44.050
Team Twilight and the Bagra 
Army have joined forces?!

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:46.670
Only until we destroy all of you.

00:11:46.670 --> 00:11:48.250
Tankmon, do it!

00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:49.690
Hyper Cannon!

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:52.860
Dorulu Tornado!

00:11:57.010 --> 00:11:58.780
Don't let the Bagra Army get ahead!

00:11:58.780 --> 00:11:59.360
Yes, sir!

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:02.120
Guardromon! Attack together!

00:12:02.120 --> 00:12:04.370
Destruction Grenade!

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:14.680
Taiki! What are you waiting for?!

00:12:14.680 --> 00:12:15.580
Right!

00:12:24.920 --> 00:12:26.020
Shoutmon!

00:12:26.020 --> 00:12:27.330
Okay!

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:29.080
Ballistamon!

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:30.190
Dorulumon!

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:31.670
Starmons!

00:12:31.670 --> 00:12:32.260
Yes!

00:12:32.260 --> 00:12:33.980
DigiXros!

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:35.900
DigiXros!

00:12:37.570 --> 00:12:40.650
Shoutmon X4!

00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:46.060
Burning Star Crusher!

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:54.750
We are Xros Heart,

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:58.120
a bond of burning hearts 
that will change this world.

00:12:58.120 --> 00:13:01.030
Make sure you remember it!

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:03.940
Our turn!

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:06.260
Heavy Tailhook!

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:09.480
Giga Destroyer!

00:13:11.070 --> 00:13:13.970
Cyber Blader!

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:17.680
Taiki, you go save Nene!

00:13:18.070 --> 00:13:20.110
Yeah! Leave this to us!

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:22.270
Shoutmon... Kiriha...

00:13:22.270 --> 00:13:23.450
Get on!

00:13:23.450 --> 00:13:25.250
Okay! Counting on you!

00:13:32.220 --> 00:13:32.990
Nene!

00:13:33.350 --> 00:13:34.590
Taiki...

00:13:34.590 --> 00:13:35.930
Nene, stand back!

00:13:35.930 --> 00:13:38.100
Wing Edge!

00:13:39.930 --> 00:13:41.670
Nene, this way!

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:43.070
What are you doing?

00:13:43.070 --> 00:13:46.280
We're getting away from here...

00:13:46.280 --> 00:13:47.160
Away from DarkKnightmon!

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:50.140
I told you, this is none of your business!

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:51.700
It is my business!

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:54.510
Your sadness is my sadness!

00:13:54.510 --> 00:13:57.920
Nene, it's no fun staying 
in a place like this.

00:13:57.920 --> 00:13:58.880
Come with us.

00:13:58.880 --> 00:14:00.920
I can't... Yuu is...

00:14:01.740 --> 00:14:04.820
As long as my brother is 
in DarkKnightmon's hands...

00:14:06.270 --> 00:14:08.990
Kiriha told you to get stronger.

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:11.430
He said only strength can heal sadness.

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:14.350
But I don't quite believe that.

00:14:15.840 --> 00:14:18.390
If you feel sad,

00:14:18.390 --> 00:14:21.310
I want to share that sadness with you.

00:14:21.310 --> 00:14:24.940
And I want to get rid of 
that sadness together.

00:14:25.270 --> 00:14:26.180
Together...

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:29.520
So I swear we'll save your brother, too.

00:14:29.520 --> 00:14:31.880
Believe me and come with us.

00:14:41.090 --> 00:14:43.330
Yay!

00:14:45.760 --> 00:14:50.470
Listen to my once in a 
lifetime taiko performance!

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:54.240
Victorize Boomerang!

00:15:17.100 --> 00:15:18.260
Taiki!

00:15:18.260 --> 00:15:20.110
You saved Nene!

00:15:20.830 --> 00:15:22.300
Come on, this way!

00:15:22.300 --> 00:15:24.370
Taiki, I'll fight, too!

00:15:24.720 --> 00:15:25.150
All right!

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:40.250
Shoutmon X4!

00:15:40.690 --> 00:15:42.290
Sparrowmon!

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:44.870
DigiXros!

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:46.720
DigiXros!

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:03.340
Shoutmon X5!

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:11.050
Meteor Buster Attack!

00:16:18.760 --> 00:16:20.430
We did it!

00:16:22.300 --> 00:16:24.530
Your back is wide open, little boy.

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:26.100
Bullet Hammer!

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:28.400
What?!

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:34.270
Pinocchimon! Everyone!

00:16:34.270 --> 00:16:37.420
Taiki, here's the treasure 
I found in this Zone!

00:16:37.420 --> 00:16:38.380
Use it!

00:16:40.340 --> 00:16:41.650
A DigiMemory!

00:16:41.970 --> 00:16:42.950
All right!

00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:44.720
<b>MetalGarurumon</b>

00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:44.720
<b>Attack: Cocytus Breath</b>

00:16:43.370 --> 00:16:46.350
Legendary Digimon, lend us your strength!

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:48.710
DigiMemory!

00:16:49.550 --> 00:16:51.060
MetalGarurumon!

00:16:57.830 --> 00:16:59.530
MetalGreymon!

00:16:59.900 --> 00:17:01.420
Cyberdramon!

00:17:01.420 --> 00:17:02.900
DigiXros!

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:06.590
Cocytus Breath!

00:17:18.950 --> 00:17:21.290
Cyber Launcher!

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:31.990
The Tankmon army was wiped out?

00:17:31.990 --> 00:17:33.870
This is no good! No good, no good!

00:17:33.870 --> 00:17:34.870
Lilithmon!

00:17:36.100 --> 00:17:37.500
DarkKnightmon!

00:17:37.500 --> 00:17:39.470
You're the only ones left.

00:17:39.470 --> 00:17:42.360
Do you think you've won?

00:17:42.360 --> 00:17:44.610
DarkKnightmon, where is my brother?

00:17:44.610 --> 00:17:45.900
Where is Yuu?

00:17:45.900 --> 00:17:46.840
Give Yuu back to me!

00:17:46.840 --> 00:17:50.410
Nene, I have no further use for you.

00:17:50.410 --> 00:17:53.160
I have already obtained the evil power

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:56.720
to restore the Darkness Loader.

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:58.920
That's the Darkness Loader?

00:17:58.920 --> 00:18:00.990
Touching that thing made me...

00:18:00.990 --> 00:18:03.730
What is that? I've heard of no such thing.

00:18:02.700 --> 00:18:03.730
No good! No good!

00:18:04.140 --> 00:18:05.720
And now, at last,

00:18:05.720 --> 00:18:09.980
the time has come to initiate the 
true power of the Darkness Loader.

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:11.800
Forced DigiXros!

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:30.120
Lilithmon, you can fight over the 
Code Crown with the rest of them.

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:31.160
You're betraying me?

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:34.760
Now that the Darkness 
Loader has activated,

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:37.430
I no longer need your assistance.

00:18:37.430 --> 00:18:41.300
I desire only to be called the strongest.

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:45.650
I intended to annihilate 
you all from the start!

00:18:48.170 --> 00:18:50.840
What tremendous power! 
At this rate we'll...

00:18:50.840 --> 00:18:52.540
I won't forget this!

00:18:52.540 --> 00:18:54.130
Everyone attack!

00:18:54.130 --> 00:18:54.810
Get him!

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:21.910
Are you okay?

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:25.290
But, man, that was some power!

00:19:27.390 --> 00:19:28.970
The Code Crown!

00:19:31.620 --> 00:19:33.950
Now the Dust Zone belongs to you, Taiki.

00:19:33.950 --> 00:19:37.520
No, I leave the future 
of this Zone to you guys.

00:19:37.520 --> 00:19:38.990
What? Us?

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:40.010
Yeah.

00:19:40.440 --> 00:19:44.960
But those other guys are 
determined to rule this Zone...

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:47.500
You really are strange.

00:19:47.500 --> 00:19:51.920
I only want the Digital 
World to be at peace.

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:55.140
Turn this Zone into a place 
everyone can live in comfortably.

00:19:55.140 --> 00:19:57.760
Okay, we'll do our best!

00:19:56.680 --> 00:19:57.760
Yes! Thank you!

00:19:58.360 --> 00:19:59.520
Taiki.

00:19:59.520 --> 00:20:03.010
Looks like I'll never have 
you as my subordinate.

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:05.700
Just remember this.

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:08.380
Starting tomorrow, we're enemies...

00:20:08.380 --> 00:20:09.790
and rivals.

00:20:10.130 --> 00:20:12.440
Kiriha, wait! Come with us and...

00:20:13.730 --> 00:20:15.240
He never changes.

00:20:15.240 --> 00:20:18.590
But if he's acknowledged Taiki 
as his rival, that means...

00:20:19.590 --> 00:20:21.470
Yeah. One day he'll...

00:20:24.340 --> 00:20:28.910
The three forces that have soiled 
my perfect battle strategies...

00:20:28.910 --> 00:20:33.480
Xros Heart, Blue Flare, and Twilight.

00:20:33.480 --> 00:20:35.840
What shall I do with you?

00:20:40.250 --> 00:20:46.260
It seems the day I must descend 
upon this world has come at last.

00:20:47.190 --> 00:20:48.590
Lord Bagramon!

00:20:53.250 --> 00:20:54.680
<b>To Be Continued</b>

