00:21:11.020 --> 00:21:14.550
<b>Spiking Fini</b>

00:21:11.130 --> 00:21:14.550
He's always flirting with Lilamon!

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:19.330
Taiki's been sent somewhere 
in the Digital realm!

00:21:19.330 --> 00:21:22.150
I don't have my Xros Loader, 
and my Wrister doesn't work!

00:21:22.150 --> 00:21:25.700
Everyone's in trouble! What can I do?!

00:21:25.700 --> 00:21:27.000
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:29.380
<b>Wisemon</b>

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:29.430
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!

